      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDiyPfAygsM",
      "content": "Potentially, I could be flexible. Yeah, there's a potential for flexibility, Saturday would be easier for me but and, and to be clear, I think I'm not looking to have like, everything moved but just some, some extra hands if that makes sense. So, yeah, potentially, I could be flexible.",
