      "user_id": "4886812291923968"
    },
    {
      "content": "Definitely. So, yeah, really. We just really charge by the hour, so you knowing additional details would help us give you an accurate quote. But yeah, at the end of the day, it is just charged by the hour we take payment once everything is completed with the actual time use. So, it still really depends on move day. But the hour the rate is, as I mentioned, we have different hour rates for days of the week, Saturday tend to get tend to be more expensive the hour rate for Saturday is $111 per hour per mover. The minimum number of movers we sent is to, so usually it's $222 if it's just two movers, you know with furniture for Sunday. The hour rate is $2,022.",
